      "title": "[Trip Reports] Packrafting  Loop Lake Powell / Glen Canyon",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=backcountrypost.com&amp;sz=128\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<div class=\"bbWrapper\">This trip was the result of lots of scouting and research.   Backcountrypost is one of the only places that you will find people talking about the Black Trail.  I definitely benefited from some posts on here, and some private messages.  Thanks! <br/>\n<br/>\nThe plan was 6 days, but got out a day early to avoid the incoming storm.  <br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<b><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">Day 1</span></b><br/>\n<br/>\nParked near Halls Crossing and did a quick hike to the 1st crossing.   Easy crossing, maybe 20 mins of paddling. <br/>\n<br/>\n<a href=\"https://backcountrypost.com/attachments/img_7439-jpg.153583/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_7439.JPG\" class=\"bbImage\" height=\"445\" src=\"https://backcountrypost.com/data/attachments/153/153615-334b999c4f3e736ca680577a7dbc5119.jpg?hash=j51I5w4ol_\" title=\"IMG_7439.JPG\" width=\"250\"/></a><br/>\n<br/>\nTook as direct a route...<br/>\n<br/>\n<a class=\"link link--internal\" href=\"https://backcountrypost.com/threads/packrafting-loop-lake-powell-glen-canyon.12753/\">Read more</a></div>",
